<title>HONG KONG: Rabobank HK branch sets HK$1.5 bln CD programme.</title>
<headline>Rabobank HK branch sets HK$1.5 bln CD programme.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> ISSUER     RABOBANK, HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$1.5 BLN</p>
<p> PROGRAMME  HK$ CD ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p> TYPE	 FIXED OR FLOATING RATE CD</p>
<p> MATURITY   1 YEAR TO 10 YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE    SALE LMITS  CUSTOMARY    TAX PROV  **</p>
<p> RATING     *	 HOME CTRY   NEDERLANDS   GOV LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	CRS DEF     NO	     FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> ARRANGER   HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p> DEALERS    HSBC MARKETS, BNP HK BRANCH, IBJ ASIA, JARDINE</p>
<p>		FLEMING, SCHRODERS ASIA AND UNION BANK OF</p>
<p>		SWITZERLAND.</p>
<p>PAY AGENT  HONGKONG BANK LEGAL COUNSEL  ALLEN &amp; OVERY</p>
<p> NOTES     *PARENT RATINGS Aaa/AAA.</p>
<p>	    **WITHHOLDING TAX GROSS UP</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
